MA Plot:
Differential expression analysis was performed for:
   •	SC/B vs BM 
   •	SC/B vs LN 
   •	SC/B vs SP 
An MA plot shows the relationship between gene expression level and fold change. The three comparisons showed similar patterns.

Biological Interpretation:
The similar patterns across the three comparisons indicate that SC/B has a different gene expression profile from those of the three peripheral tissues. 

